{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）上午9時42分，警方接獲報案，指何文田自由道4號一個建築地盤內，一輛起重機懷疑翻側，造成2人受傷。救援人員接報趕至，證實該名工人已當場不治。據報有另一名男工人受傷。警方正就事故成因展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院搶救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207797742080000063748.jpeg/EmxLuDPxfyA6UfA9gnBFB1mr5SQcxy31I9Ei3iPRIt4\"/><figcaption>傷者送院搶救。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148206109077540864362741.jpeg/X9ddkAA8TI1AyIO9I62Q_H4BgRsj-HxAbI2io2yNoqM\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T02:19:59.269770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}